document.cookie = "name=value; expires=Thu, 04 Jan 98 05:00:00 GMT";

// Clearing a cookie
document.cookie = '';
```

These three types of storage provide different levels of persistence and manageability depending upon what kind of data needs to be saved and how long it should persist.

